            <ArticleTitle>A case of a pulmonary artery sling misdiagnosed as refractory asthma for 20 years.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>863-866</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ccr3.960</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a 25-year-old woman with a pulmonary artery sling who was misdiagnosed as having childhood-onset refractory asthma for approximately 20 years. The use of computed tomography may be useful for diagnosing this rare condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
